---
import Logo from "../images/Logo.svg";
---

<section
  id="AboutUs"
  class="h-full xl:h-[75dvh] w-full flex flex-col items-center p-10 bg-primary"
>
  <h2 class="text-secondary">About Us</h2>
  <div
    class="flex flex-col lg:flex-row grow items-center justify-between gap-10 text-white"
  >
    <Logo class="h-100 w-full sm:w-1/2 text-secondary" />
    <div class="w-full lg:w-1/2 flex flex-col gap-5">
      <p>
        The name <span class="text-secondary font-bold italic">Casamigos</span> holds a special meaning to us — a home created for
        friends and family to gather, connect, and make lasting memories
        together. In Spanish, Casamigos translates to <span class="text-secondary font-bold italic">“house of friends”</span>, a name
        that perfectly reflects the spirit behind our villas.
      </p>
      <p>
        We created the Casamigos Villas with the vision of welcoming friends and
        families from around the world to experience the beauty, warmth, and
        tranquility of the sunny Turks and Caicos. More than just a place to
        stay, <span class="text-secondary font-bold italic">Casamigos is meant to feel like your home away from home — a place
        where unforgettable moments are shared together.</span>
      </p>
      <p>
        Nestled in the heart of Providenciales, this beautifully designed
        <span class="text-secondary font-bold italic">eco-friendly luxury villa</span> offers the perfect blend of modern island
        living and privacy. Situated on a spacious 0.33-acre parcel, this
        exceptional residence features 3 bedrooms and 3.5 bathrooms,
        thoughtfully <span class="text-secondary font-bold italic">crafted with comfort, sustainability, and tropical elegance
        in mind.</span>
      </p>
      <p>
        The home welcomes you through a private gated driveway, creating an
        <span class="text-secondary font-bold italic">exclusive and serene retreat</span> from the moment you arrive. Inside,
        open-concept living spaces seamlessly connect to the outdoor
        entertaining areas, allowing natural light and island breezes to flow
        throughout the home.
      </p>
      <p>
        Step outside to your own private swimming pool surrounded by lush
        tropical landscaping, perfect for relaxing under the Caribbean sun. The
        outdoor cooking and entertainment area creates an ideal setting for
        hosting family and friends while enjoying the beautiful island
        atmosphere. Just across the street, the sparkling turquoise waters
        <span class="text-secondary font-bold italic">provide breathtaking views and easy access to the ocean lifestyle</span> that
        makes Turks and Caicos Islands so desirable.
      </p>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
